  "description": "Fantasy romance over a cup of coffee.\n\nSam-Wol, a nine-tailed fox, unwittingly turns into a human after eating her thousandth liver in an attempt to become a mountain god. After descending the mountain, she meets Jong-Man, who employs her as a part-timer at his café. Can romance blossom between these two \"humans\"? \n\n(Souce: Manta, edited)",
